  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### This client is 75 years old. How can we stop Capium from including class 4 NIC?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  2:04 PM\n\n\t\tYou need to add self-employment short form in supplementary pages and then tick the checkbox 37 “you are exempted to pay class 4 NIC” \n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
